    "description": "<p>After a long rest, place a number of tokens equal to your Spellcast trait on this card. Touch a creature and spend any number of tokens to clear 2 Hit Points or 2 Stress for each token spent.</p><p>You can also spend a token from this card when touching a creature to clear the <em>Vulnerable</em> condition or heal a physical or magical ailment (the GM might require additional tokens depending on the strength of the ailment).</p><p>When you take a long rest, clear all unspent tokens.</p>",
